  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivering Mine Action through strengthened national and sub-national capacity and coordination in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the critical requirement to fill key positions within the Mine Action Sub-Cluster to increase the effectiveness of coordination of international and local partners - as well as provide improvements to the way UNDP and local authorities address changing needs on the ground. The project strengthens national, regional and oblast-level responses to the humanitarian crisis, it improves the delivery of sector-wide reporting, and it facilitates the transfer of key responsibilities</narrative>
  </description>
